{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How is the demo different than the full game?</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one map in the demo. The full game has an infinite number of maps because they are procedurally generated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only play with others through invite codes in the demo. In the full game, you can also join random matches through matchmaking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is this demo the final game?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, Few Shall Return is still under development. The demo is under development as well and will get regular updates. We're aiming for a two-weeks cadence but that might change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How can I get involved?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for wanting to help! Your feedback during this stage means the world to us! Here's what you can do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and share your feedback with us</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to play together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord channel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for playtest opportunities. We regularly invite players to try unreleased features, some which might only be for the full game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What's next?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next game update is planned for Sept 26.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not Everyone Leaves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/9212126609be7da420f0c99bc199a57c.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/9212126609be7da420f0c99bc199a57c.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/9212126609be7da420f0c99bc199a57c.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a dungeon where only some will make it out: for every player who dies, one other player can escape. You have to work together to fight enemies and solve puzzles, but when the exit appears, it\u2019s every player for themselves. Bring whatever equipment you want to increase you chances but if you die, you lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer RPG, Short Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/d6c1f80fc72b2fb202b13ea270bd267a.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/d6c1f80fc72b2fb202b13ea270bd267a.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/d6c1f80fc72b2fb202b13ea270bd267a.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts 10\u201315 minutes, delivering a full RPG experience in a short session. No grinding, no waiting\u2014just action, strategy, and high-stakes decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/91d26284a9c9c4057ec7ebee02000d4c.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/91d26284a9c9c4057ec7ebee02000d4c.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/91d26284a9c9c4057ec7ebee02000d4c.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are procedurally generated with randomized rooms, enemies, and obstacles. No two runs are the same. Adapt, take risks, and learn from failure\u2014because death is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Tradeoffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/f0fe24e82b154c55c0c29626ba02344d.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/f0fe24e82b154c55c0c29626ba02344d.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/f0fe24e82b154c55c0c29626ba02344d.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory space is limited. Choose what to bring in and what to take out. Weapons, potions, keys, or treasure\u2014you can\u2019t carry everything. Make every item count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classes &amp; Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple classes, each with unique abilities. Some excel in combat, others in support or utility. Your class determines how you survive\u2014and how you compete.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970740?t=1757953820","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/bbc9be9828a804212a88822e4a4c2d74de49281c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757953820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/9a9347501c00b961cba5bf7050fd06a65f3cd59e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757953820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/9a9347501c00b961cba5bf7050fd06a65f3cd59e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757953820","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains fantasy violence where you fight other players and enemies in a dungeon."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How is the demo different than the full game?</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's only one map in the demo. The full game has an infinite number of maps because they are procedurally generated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only play with others through invite codes in the demo. In the full game, you can also join random matches through matchmaking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is this demo the final game?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, Few Shall Return is still under development. The demo is under development as well and will get regular updates. We're aiming for a two-weeks cadence but that might change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How can I get involved?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for wanting to help! Your feedback during this stage means the world to us! Here's what you can do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and share your feedback with us</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to play together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord channel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for playtest opportunities. We regularly invite players to try unreleased features, some which might only be for the full game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What's next?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next game update is planned for Sept 26.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not Everyone Leaves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/9212126609be7da420f0c99bc199a57c.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/9212126609be7da420f0c99bc199a57c.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/9212126609be7da420f0c99bc199a57c.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a dungeon where only some will make it out: for every player who dies, one other player can escape. You have to work together to fight enemies and solve puzzles, but when the exit appears, it\u2019s every player for themselves. Bring whatever equipment you want to increase you chances but if you die, you lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer RPG, Short Rounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/d6c1f80fc72b2fb202b13ea270bd267a.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/d6c1f80fc72b2fb202b13ea270bd267a.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/d6c1f80fc72b2fb202b13ea270bd267a.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts 10\u201315 minutes, delivering a full RPG experience in a short session. No grinding, no waiting\u2014just action, strategy, and high-stakes decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/91d26284a9c9c4057ec7ebee02000d4c.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/91d26284a9c9c4057ec7ebee02000d4c.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/91d26284a9c9c4057ec7ebee02000d4c.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are procedurally generated with randomized rooms, enemies, and obstacles. No two runs are the same. Adapt, take risks, and learn from failure\u2014because death is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Tradeoffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/f0fe24e82b154c55c0c29626ba02344d.poster.avif?t=1757953820\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/f0fe24e82b154c55c0c29626ba02344d.webm?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/extras/f0fe24e82b154c55c0c29626ba02344d.mp4?t=1757953820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory space is limited. Choose what to bring in and what to take out. Weapons, potions, keys, or treasure\u2014you can\u2019t carry everything. Make every item count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classes &amp; Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple classes, each with unique abilities. Some excel in combat, others in support or utility. Your class determines how you survive\u2014and how you compete.</p>","developers":["Ballard Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3377400","name":"Few Shall Return"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/bd3319de924c16ca124e2c622bb0075ff2878299/header.jpg?t=1757953820","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257197054,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197054/movie480.mp4?t=1757717938","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197054/movie_max.mp4?t=1757717938"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197054/a45c927d41c8605ed082574fa8118c4f296c2ce7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757717938","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197054/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757717938","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197054/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757717938"}}],"name":"Few Shall Return Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requireme