kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/2da4baa0e35c6f20e4104d42388718f9d743b3b4/ss_2da4baa0e35c6f20e4104d42388718f9d743b3b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757953820","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/2da4baa0e35c6f20e4104d42388718f9d743b3b4/ss_2da4baa0e35c6f20e4104d42388718f9d743b3b4.600x338.jpg?t=1757953820"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/4d2715f260ae9b317d949b11ecfccfc81c4323b7/ss_4d2715f260ae9b317d949b11ecfccfc81c4323b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757953820","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/4d2715f260ae9b317d949b11ecfccfc81c4323b7/ss_4d2715f260ae9b317d949b11ecfccfc81c4323b7.600x338.jpg?t=1757953820"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/695b63ddacd79335b6f2b40714742958d52d449e/ss_695b63ddacd79335b6f2b40714742958d52d449e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757953820","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/695b63ddacd79335b6f2b40714742958d52d449e/ss_695b63ddacd79335b6f2b40714742958d52d449e.600x338.jpg?t=1757953820"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/61da5ed0fd6d6380c3df19492a1f048bcf51f754/ss_61da5ed0fd6d6380c3df19492a1f048bcf51f754.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757953820","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970740/61da5ed0fd6d6380c3df19492a1f048bcf51f754/ss_61da5ed0fd6d6380c3df19492a1f048bcf51f754.600x338.jpg?t=1757953820"}],"short_description":"You\u2019ve entered a dungeon with other adventurers, but only a few of you will be allowed to leave. Work together to solve challenges, but escape alone. Risk losing what you bring with you, but keep all the loot that you can carry\u2026 if you make it out alive. Multiplayer RPG experience with short rounds.","steam_appid":3970740,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://www.ballardgames.com/contact.html"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":null}